      "writtenOn": "2026-10-27T16:03:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The kernel host command timeout is 200 ms on SPI (EC_MSG_DEADLINE_MS: https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromiumos/third_party/kernel/+/2285265320e762ef1f408bedc6ad23c56cc94944/drivers/platform/chrome/cros_ec_spi.c#52) and 1 s on LPC (ec_response_timed_out: https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromiumos/third_party/kernel/+/2285265320e762ef1f408bedc6ad23c56cc94944/drivers/platform/chrome/cros_ec_lpc.c#129), coreboot waits up to 30 s (https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromiumos/third_party/coreboot/+/7848938f15b07ed88394a6f2f888521810f2f529/src/ec/google/chromeec/ec_lpc.c#106), and depthcharge waits up to 1 s on SPI (ProcessTimeoutUs: https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromiumos/platform/depthcharge/+/da704d71f10a705b1b28b6e569ad3277e4352985/src/drivers/ec/cros/spi.c#38) and 100 ms / 30 s on LPC (https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromiumos/platform/depthcharge/+/da704d71f10a705b1b28b6e569ad3277e4352985/src/drivers/ec/cros/lpc.c#175).",
